# The one-off scripts above stay out of the repo, but run-all.ps1 is tracked and calls
# these four on every pipeline run — a clone without them cannot export or import at all.
# None carries a credential: the exports use Windows auth, the imports read DATABASE_URL.
#
# Shop #41 is GenX CompanyId 1 -> company_id 1; Shop #58 is GenX CompanyId 3 -> company_id 2.
# Both halves have to be tracked or the pipeline silently imports only one shop.
!export-all.ps1
!import-all-safe.js
!export-company3.ps1
!import-company2-safe.js
